# Anxiety Index brief: week ending 2026-11-07

*Issued 2026-11-13. Data through 2026-11-13.*

## 66 — Elevated, down 3.4 on the week

Attention is spread across many stories, so new ones find room.

**So far this week:** 57 (Elevated), -8.8 against the completed week. Provisional; it will move as the week's data arrive.

